---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import BlogPost from '../components/BlogPost.astro';

const title = "Best Shopify Competitor Price Monitoring Tools (2026)";
const description = "The best tools to monitor competitor prices for Shopify stores in 2026. Compare Talon, Prisync, Price2Spy, Minderest, and Competera — real-time alerts and actionable insights reviewed.";
---

<Layout title={`${title} — Talon`}>
  <BlogPost
    title={title}
    description={description}
    category="Platform"
    readTime="6 min read"
    updated="Jan 2026"
  >
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="lead">Your competitors are changing prices daily — flash discounts, inventory-based increases, undercutting strategies. If you're not tracking in real time, you're either losing sales or leaving money on the table.</p>

      <div class="scenario-strip">
        <div class="sc-item">
          <span class="sc-tag">Scenario 1</span>
          <div class="sc-title">Competitor runs flash discount</div>
          <div class="sc-impact sc-impact-r">−$240/day if ignored</div>
          <div class="sc-desc">You're now 15% above market. Customers compare and leave.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="sc-item">
          <span class="sc-tag">Scenario 2</span>
          <div class="sc-title">Competitor raises price — supply squeeze</div>
          <div class="sc-impact sc-impact-g">+9% margin window</div>
          <div class="sc-desc">You stay put. You leave money on the table for 4 days.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="sc-item">
          <span class="sc-tag">Scenario 3</span>
          <div class="sc-title">New store undercuts your hero SKU</div>
          <div class="sc-impact sc-impact-r">−$180/day risk</div>
          <div class="sc-desc">Unknown domain, zero reviews — but you don't know that.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 id="comparison">Quick comparison</h2>
      <p>Five tools that Shopify sellers commonly evaluate — judged on the two metrics that actually move revenue: reaction speed and quality of output.</p>

      <div class="comparison-wrap">
        <table class="comparison-table">
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Tool</th><th>Best For</th><th>Real-Time</th><th>Actionable</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="hl">
              <td><span class="tc-icon">🎯</span> Talon <span class="us-chip">This guide</span></td>
              <td>Fast pricing decisions</td>
              <td><span class="chk-yes">✓</span></td>
              <td><span class="chk-yes">✓</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Prisync</td>
              <td>Competitor tracking</td>
              <td><span class="chk-warn">⚠</span></td>
              <td><span class="chk-no">✗</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Price2Spy</td>
              <td>Large catalogs</td>
              <td><span class="chk-warn">⚠</span></td>
              <td><span class="chk-no">✗</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Minderest</td>
              <td>Enterprise analytics</td>
              <td><span class="chk-warn">⚠</span></td>
              <td><span class="chk-no">✗</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Competera</td>
              <td>AI pricing (enterprise)</td>
              <td><span class="chk-warn">⚠</span></td>
              <td><span class="chk-warn">⚠</span></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="parasite-section">
        <h3>Best Prisync alternative for real-time pricing</h3>
        <p>If you're currently using Prisync, the biggest limitation becomes obvious once competitors start moving faster than your update cycle. Monitoring is useful — but without real-time reaction, you're still losing sales.</p>
        <p>Talon approaches this differently. Instead of delayed tracking, it detects price changes instantly and suggests the exact price to set based on estimated impact.</p>
      </div>

      <hr/>

      <h2 id="talon">1. Talon — Best for real-time pricing decisions</h2>
      <div class="tool-card featured">
        <div class="tc-head">
          <div class="tc-head-left">
            <span class="tc-rank">#1 — Editor's Pick</span>
            <div class="tc-name">Talon</div>
            <div class="tc-tagline">The only Shopify pricing tool that tells you what to do, not just what happened.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tc-v">
            <span class="v-lbl">Verdict</span>
            <span class="v-badge vb-best">Best Overall</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tc-body">
          <p class="tc-desc">Talon is designed around a single insight: <strong>a price alert without a recommended action is just noise.</strong> Every event includes the estimated daily revenue impact, a specific suggested price, and the likely reason behind the competitor's move.</p>
          <div class="tc-stats">
            <div class="tc-stat"><span class="tc-stat-lbl">Detection</span><span class="tc-stat-val" style="color:var(--grn-txt)">Real-time</span></div>
            <div class="tc-stat"><span class="tc-stat-lbl">Output</span><span class="tc-stat-val" style="color:var(--grn-txt)">Decision + $$ impact</span></div>
            <div class="tc-stat"><span class="tc-stat-lbl">Platforms</span><span class="tc-stat-val">Shopify · Amazon</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="tc-pc">
            <div class="pc-col">
              <span class="pc-lbl pc-lbl-g">Strengths</span>
              <div class="pc-item"><span class="dot-g">✓</span>Real-time detection the moment a competitor moves</div>
              <div class="pc-item"><span class="dot-g">✓</span>Shows exact daily revenue loss or margin gain</div>
              <div class="pc-item"><span class="dot-g">✓</span>Recommends a specific price — not a vague direction</div>
              <div class="pc-item"><span class="dot-g">✓</span>Explains the likely reason behind the change</div>
              <div class="pc-item"><span class="dot-g">✓</span>Confidence score on every recommendation</div>
            </div>
            <div class="pc-col">
              <span class="pc-lbl pc-lbl-r">Limitations</span>
              <div class="pc-item"><span class="dot-r">✗</span>Newer product — smaller historical dataset</div>
              <div class="pc-item"><span class="dot-r">✗</span>Not for passive analytics teams</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="callout callout-g">
        <p><strong>What a Talon alert looks like:</strong> "Competitor dropped price on Summer Tee by 11% — you're losing <strong>$190/day</strong>. Drop to $34 to stay competitive. Flash sale pattern — expected to last 2–4 days."</p>
      </div>

      <hr/>

      <h2 id="prisync">2. Prisync — Reliable tracking, no action layer</h2>
      <div class="tool-card">
        <div class="tc-head">
          <div class="tc-head-left"><span class="tc-rank">#2</span><div class="tc-name">Prisync</div><div class="tc-tagline">Established competitor price tracker with broad eCommerce coverage.</div></div>
          <div class="tc-v"><span class="v-lbl">Verdict</span><span class="v-badge vb-ok">Good for monitoring</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tc-body">
          <p class="tc-desc">One of the most widely adopted price monitoring tools. Reliable, covers most platforms. The gap: it surfaces data but stops there. No recommendations, no impact estimation.</p>
          <div class="tc-pc">
            <div class="pc-col"><span class="pc-lbl pc-lbl-g">Strengths</span>
              <div class="pc-item"><span class="dot-g">✓</span>Easy setup and broad platform coverage</div>
              <div class="pc-item"><span class="dot-g">✓</span>Decent alert system</div>
              <div class="pc-item"><span class="dot-g">✓</span>Clean dashboard</div>
            </div>
            <div class="pc-col"><span class="pc-lbl pc-lbl-r">Limitations</span>
              <div class="pc-item"><span class="dot-r">✗</span>Detection lags by hours</div>
              <div class="pc-item"><span class="dot-r">✗</span>No revenue impact estimates</div>
              <div class="pc-item"><span class="dot-r">✗</span>All interpretation is manual</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr/>

      <h2 id="price2spy">3. Price2Spy — Scale without speed</h2>
      <div class="tool-card">
        <div class="tc-head">
          <div class="tc-head-left"><span class="tc-rank">#3</span><div class="tc-name">Price2Spy</div><div class="tc-tagline">Enterprise-grade catalog monitoring.</div></div>
          <div class="tc-v"><span class="v-lbl">Verdict</span><span class="v-badge vb-ok">Large catalogs only</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tc-body">
          <p class="tc-desc">Handles scale well for thousands of SKUs. Better for monthly analysis than daily decisions.</p>
          <div class="tc-cons">
            <span class="tc-cons-lbl">Key limitations</span>
            <div class="con-item"><span class="con-dot">✗</span>Slower update cycles — not for flash sales</div>
            <div class="con-item"><span class="con-dot">✗</span>Complex setup and learning curve</div>
            <div class="con-item"><span class="con-dot">✗</span>No decision support</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="parasite-section">
        <h3>Tools like Price2Spy but faster</h3>
        <p>Tools like Price2Spy are designed for structured monitoring and reporting. They work well for large teams that review pricing periodically.</p>
        <p>But for operators who need to react immediately, these workflows introduce delay — and delay directly impacts revenue.</p>
      </div>

      <hr/>

      <h2 id="minderest">4. Minderest — Deep analytics, wrong audience</h2>
      <div class="tool-card">
        <div class="tc-head">
          <div class="tc-head-left"><span class="tc-rank">#4</span><div class="tc-name">Minderest</div><div class="tc-tagline">Enterprise pricing intelligence.</div></div>
          <div class="tc-v"><span class="v-lbl">Verdict</span><span class="v-badge vb-lim">Enterprise only</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tc-body">
          <p class="tc-desc">Full analytics platform built for large retail organizations. For Shopify operators who need to act fast, it's overkill.</p>
          <div class="tc-cons">
            <span class="tc-cons-lbl">Key limitations</span>
            <div class="con-item"><span class="con-dot">✗</span>Priced for enterprise, not Shopify stores</div>
            <div class="con-item"><span class="con-dot">✗</span>Heavy analytics, light on action</div>
            <div class="con-item"><span class="con-dot">✗</span>Significant onboarding required</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr/>

      <h2 id="competera">5. Competera — Advanced AI, complex deployment</h2>
      <div class="tool-card">
        <div class="tc-head">
          <div class="tc-head-left"><span class="tc-rank">#5</span><div class="tc-name">Competera</div><div class="tc-tagline">AI-driven pricing optimization.</div></div>
          <div class="tc-v"><span class="v-lbl">Verdict</span><span class="v-badge vb-lim">Complex to deploy</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tc-body">
          <p class="tc-desc">Uses demand elasticity modeling and AI to optimize prices at scale. For most Shopify stores, the configuration time and cost make it impractical.</p>
          <div class="tc-cons">
            <span class="tc-cons-lbl">Key limitations</span>
            <div class="con-item"><span class="con-dot">✗</span>Weeks of configuration</div>
            <div class="con-item"><span class="con-dot">✗</span>Requires dedicated pricing expertise</div>
            <div class="con-item"><span class="con-dot">✗</span>Too slow for flash sales</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr/>

      <h2 id="speed">Why reaction time is the only metric that matters</h2>
      <p>A competitor's flash discount can shift purchase intent within minutes. By the time a delayed alert reaches you, you may have already lost hours of sales.</p>

      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-time">10:00</div><div class="tl-content"><div class="tl-event">Competitor drops price on your top SKU by 12%</div><div class="tl-sub">They're now $14 cheaper</div></div></div>
        <div class="tl-row tl-bad"><div class="tl-time">10:00–14:00</div><div class="tl-content"><div class="tl-event">Without real-time: you don't know</div><div class="tl-sub">4 hours of lost sales — roughly $160</div></div></div>
        <div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-time">14:20</div><div class="tl-content"><div class="tl-event">Delayed alert arrives</div><div class="tl-sub">Still need to analyze and decide</div></div></div>
        <div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-time">15:00</div><div class="tl-content"><div class="tl-event">You finally update the price</div><div class="tl-sub">5 hours after the change — $200+ lost</div></div></div>
        <div class="tl-row tl-good"><div class="tl-time">10:01</div><div class="tl-content"><div class="tl-event">With Talon: alert in 60 seconds</div><div class="tl-sub">"Drop to $112 — you're losing $240/day"</div></div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="parasite-section">
        <h3>Is Keepa enough for real-time pricing?</h3>
        <p>Keepa is one of the most powerful tools for historical price tracking on Amazon. But it's not built for real-time decisions.</p>
        <p>If your goal is to react to competitor price changes as they happen — not hours later — you need a different approach.</p>
      </div>

      <hr/>

      <h2 id="why">What most monitoring tools skip</h2>
      <p>Every tool will tell you a competitor changed their price. The gap is everything after — and that's where Shopify sellers lose money.</p>

      <div class="skip-grid">
        <div class="skip-cell">
          <div class="skip-lbl skip-lbl-r">What most give you</div>
          <div class="skip-item"><span class="skip-arrow">→</span>Dashboard showing prices changed</div>
          <div class="skip-item"><span class="skip-arrow">→</span>Alert says "price dropped 11%"</div>
          <div class="skip-item"><span class="skip-arrow">→</span>Report you can export</div>
        </div>
        <div class="skip-cell">
          <div class="skip-lbl skip-lbl-g">What you actually need</div>
          <div class="skip-item"><span class="skip-arrow">→</span>Real threat or temporary?</div>
          <div class="skip-item"><span class="skip-arrow">→</span>How much am I losing per day?</div>
          <div class="skip-item"><span class="skip-arrow">→</span>What exact price should I set?</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr/>

      <h2 id="who">Who should use which tool</h2>

      <div class="who-grid">
        <div class="who-card">
          <span class="who-tag">Simple tracking</span>
          <div class="who-title">Prisync</div>
          <div class="who-desc">If you have a pricing analyst checking dashboards daily.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="who-card">
          <span class="who-tag">Large catalog</span>
          <div class="who-title">Price2Spy</div>
          <div class="who-desc">1000+ SKUs needing systematic tracking.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="who-card">
          <span class="who-tag">Enterprise</span>
          <div class="who-title">Competera or Minderest</div>
          <div class="who-desc">Dedicated pricing teams with large budgets.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="who-card">
          <span class="who-tag">Active Shopify seller</span>
          <div class="who-title who-tool-grn">Talon</div>
          <div class="who-desc">React faster than competitors, protect margin.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr/>

      <h2 id="takeaway">Final takeaway</h2>
      <p>In eCommerce, speed wins. The tool that tells you about a price change two hours after it happened is documenting your losses, not preventing them.</p>
      <p><strong>If you run a Shopify store and your edge depends on reacting faster — Talon is the only tool built for that.</strong> Real-time detection, dollar impact, specific suggested price.</p>

      <div class="article-cta">
        <div class="cta-left">
          <span class="cta-eyebrow">Free analysis — no signup</span>
          <div class="cta-title">See where your Shopify pricing stands right now</div>
          <div class="cta-sub">Paste your product URL and a competitor. Get impact and price in seconds.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cta-right">
          <a href="/#tool" class="cta-btn">→ Start free analysis</a>
          <span class="cta-note">No account · No credit card</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div slot="sidebar">
      <div class="sidebar-cta">
        <span class="sb-title">Are you priced right?</span>
        <div class="sb-desc">Paste your Shopify product and competitor. Get real-time analysis in seconds.</div>
        <a href="/#tool" class="sb-btn">→ Analyze your product</a>
        <span class="sb-note">No signup · No credit card</span>
      </div>

      <div class="sidebar-toc">
        <div class="sb-lbl">In this article</div>
        <ul class="toc-list">
          <li class="toc-item"><a href="#comparison"><span class="toc-num">01</span>Quick comparison</a></li>
          <li class="toc-item"><a href="#talon"><span class="toc-num">02</span>Talon</a></li>
          <li class="toc-item"><a href="#prisync"><span class="toc-num">03</span>Prisync</a></li>
          <li class="toc-item"><a href="#price2spy"><span class="toc-num">04</span>Price2Spy</a></li>
          <li class="toc-item"><a href="#minderest"><span class="toc-num">05</span>Minderest</a></li>
          <li class="toc-item"><a href="#competera"><span class="toc-num">06</span>Competera</a></li>
          <li class="toc-item"><a href="#speed"><span class="toc-num">07</span>Why speed matters</a></li>
          <li class="toc-item"><a href="#why"><span class="toc-num">08</span>What tools skip</a></li>
          <li class="toc-item"><a href="#who"><span class="toc-num">09</span>Who uses what</a></li>
          <li class="toc-item"><a href="#takeaway"><span class="toc-num">10</span>Final takeaway</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="sidebar-related">
        <div class="sb-lbl">Related articles</div>
        <div class="rel-list">
          <div class="rel-item"><span class="rel-cat">Tools</span><a href="/best-competitor-price-tracking-tools" class="rel-title">Best Competitor Price Tracking Tools</a></div>
          <div class="rel-item"><span class="rel-cat">Amazon</span><a href="/best-amazon-price-tracking-tools" class="rel-title">Best Amazon Price Tracking Tools</a></div>
          <div class="rel-item"><span class="rel-cat">Problem</span><a href="/why-your-product-is-not-selling" class="rel-title">Why Your Product Is Not Selling</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </BlogPost>
</Layout>

<style>
.prose{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0}
.prose h2{font-family:var(--display);font-size:24px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.4px;color:var(--t1);margin:48px 0 16px;line-height:1.25;scroll-margin-top:80px}
.prose p{color:var(--t2);margin-bottom:18px;font-size:var(--body-size);line-height:var(--body-lh)}
.prose strong{color:var(--t1);font-weight:600}
.prose hr{border:none;border-top:1px solid var(--border);margin:40px 0}

.parasite-section{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:22px 26px;margin:32px 0}
.parasite-section h3{font-family:var(--display);font-size:17px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.2px;color:var(--t1);margin:0 0 10px}
.parasite-section p{font-size:14px;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 8px}
.parasite-section p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}

.lead{font-size:19px;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:24px}

.scenario-strip{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--border);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;margin:0 0 40px}
.sc-item{background:var(--bg1);padding:20px 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.sc-tag{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--t3)}
.sc-title{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:var(--t1);letter-spacing:-0.1px}
.sc-impact{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;font-weight:500;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:4px;width:fit-content;margin-top:2px}
.sc-impact-r{background:var(--red-lo);color:var(--red-txt);border:1px solid var(--red-bd)}
.sc-impact-g{background:var(--grn-lo);color:var(--grn-txt);border:1px solid var(--grn-bd)}
.sc-desc{font-size:13px;color:var(--t3);line-height:1.5}

.comparison-wrap{overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 40px}
.comparison-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px}
.comparison-table thead tr{background:var(--bg2)}
.comparison-table th{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--t3);padding:12px 18px;text-align:left}
.comparison-table tbody tr{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.comparison-table td{padding:13px 18px;color:var(--t2)}
.comparison-table td:first-child{color:var(--t1);font-weight:500}
.hl{background:var(--bg2)}
.tc-icon{margin-right:6px}
.us-chip{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--amb-lo);color:var(--amb-txt);border:1px solid var(--amb-bd)}
.chk-yes{color:var(--grn-txt)}
.chk-warn{color:var(--amb-txt)}
.chk-no{color:var(--t3)}

.tool-card{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;margin:28px 0;background:var(--bg1)}
.tool-card.featured{border-color:var(--border-md);background:var(--bg2)}
.tc-head{padding:22px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}
.tc-head-left{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}
.tc-rank{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--t3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px}
.tc-name{font-family:var(--display);font-size:21px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.3px;color:var(--t1)}
.tc-tagline{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--t2);margin-top:2px}
.tc-v{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;gap:4px}
.v-lbl{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;color:var(--t3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.8px}
.v-badge{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;font-weight:500;padding:4px 11px;border-radius:5px}
.vb-best{background:var(--grn-lo);color:var(--grn-txt);border:1px solid var(--grn-bd)}
.vb-ok{background:var(--amb-lo);color:var(--amb-txt);border:1px solid var(--amb-bd)}
.vb-lim{background:var(--bg3);color:var(--t3);border:1px solid var(--border)}
.tc-body{padding:22px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}
.tc-desc{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.65}

.tc-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--border);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px}
.tc-stat{background:var(--bg3);padding:12px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}
.tc-stat-lbl{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--t3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.8px}
.tc-stat-val{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500;color:var(--t1)}

.tc-pc{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
.pc-col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.pc-lbl{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.8px;margin-bottom:2px}
.pc-lbl-g{color:var(--grn-txt)}
.pc-lbl-r{color:var(--red-txt)}
.pc-item{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:7px;font-size:13px;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.5}
.dot-g{color:var(--grn-txt);font-size:11px;margin-top:3px}
.dot-r{color:var(--red-txt);font-size:11px;margin-top:3px}

.tc-cons{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.tc-cons-lbl{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--t3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.8px}
.con-item{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--t2)}
.con-dot{color:var(--red-txt);font-size:11px;margin-top:3px}

.callout{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border-md);border-left:3px solid var(--amb-txt);border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px 20px;margin:24px 0}
.callout p{color:var(--t2);font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:0}
.callout strong{color:var(--t1)}
.callout-g{border-left-color:var(--grn-txt)}

.timeline{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;margin:28px 0}
.tl-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:72px 1fr;gap:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tl-row:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.tl-time{padding:16px 18px;background:var(--bg2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--t3);border-right:1px solid var(--border);font-weight:500}
.tl-content{padding:14px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;background:var(--bg1)}
.tl-event{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:var(--t1)}
.tl-sub{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--t3)}
.tl-bad .tl-content{background:var(--red-lo)}
.tl-bad .tl-event{color:var(--red-txt)}
.tl-good .tl-content{background:var(--grn-lo)}
.tl-good .tl-event{color:var(--grn-txt)}

.skip-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2px;background:var(--border);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;margin:24px 0}
.skip-cell{background:var(--bg2);padding:26px 28px}
.skip-lbl{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:14px}
.skip-lbl-r{color:var(--red-txt)}
.skip-lbl-g{color:var(--grn-txt)}
.skip-item{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--t2);margin-bottom:10px}
.skip-arrow{color:var(--t3);flex-shrink:0}

.who-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px;margin:24px 0}
.who-card{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.who-tag{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--t3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.8px}
.who-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--t1)}
.who-tool-grn{color:var(--grn-txt);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px}
.who-desc{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.5}

.article-cta{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border-md);border-radius:12px;padding:36px 40px;margin:48px 0 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:32px}
.cta-left{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;flex:1}
.cta-eyebrow{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--t3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px}
.cta-title{font-family:var(--display);font-size:22px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.4px;color:var(--t1);line-height:1.2}
.cta-sub{font-size:14px;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.5}
.cta-right{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;gap:8px}
.cta-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:13px 24px;background:var(--t1);color:var(--bg0);border:none;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none}
.cta-note{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--t3)}

.sidebar-cta{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border-md);border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
.sb-title{font-family:var(--display);font-size:16px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.2px;color:var(--t1)}
.sb-desc{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.55}
.sb-btn{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;padding:11px;background:var(--t1);color:var(--bg0);border:none;border-radius:7px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none}
.sb-note{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--t3);text-align:center}

.sidebar-toc{background:var(--bg1);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px}
.sb-lbl{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--t3);margin-bottom:14px}
.toc-list{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
.toc-item a{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--t3);text-decoration:none;padding:5px 0;line-height:1.45}
.toc-item a:hover{color:var(--t2)}
.toc-num{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px}

.sidebar-related{background:var(--bg1);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px}
.rel-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.rel-item{padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.rel-cat{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;color:var(--t3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.8px}
.rel-title{font-size:13px;color:var(--t2);text-decoration:none;display:block;margin-top:4px}
.rel-title:hover{color:var(--t1)}
</style>

<script>
const sections = document.querySelectorAll('h2[id]');
const tocLinks = document.querySelectorAll('.toc-item a');
const observer = new IntersectionObserver(entries => {
  entries.forEach(entry => {
    if (entry.isIntersecting) {
      const id = entry.target.getAttribute('id');
      tocLinks.forEach(l => l.classList.toggle('active-toc', l.getAttribute('href') === '#' + id));
    }
  });
}, { rootMargin: '-20% 0px -70% 0px' });
sections.forEach(s => observer.observe(s));
</script>